  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Pin the production HTTPS origin, reject redirects in the default transport, and independently verify every server reply with RSA-SHA256 and a fresh request nonce. Reject unsigned, forged, tampered and replayed replies before parsing. Existing custom endpoints are no longer supported. See CHANGELOG.md for migration details.",
